{"unit_id":"Mandarin715__dsh-autostart#card-zh","repo":"Mandarin715/dsh-autostart","commit":"4c6589403ac82aab405f55184d28353d297a3b30","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-autostart 是面向 Windows 的 DSH 插件，在 Web 客户端通用设置中提供服务状态、开机自启与重启控制。它通过设置卡调用宿主路由，并由常驻 supervisor 启动和管理 DSH。用户可以查看服务端口状态与最新访问地址、复制地址、启用或停用登录时自启、配置服务启动后的钩子脚本，以及请求重启服务。适合希望在 Windows 上让 DSH 随登录启动并从设置页管理服务的用户。需要 Windows 和 Node.js 20 或更高版本，不需要额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:303-324","index.js:648-669","service.js:4-20"]}
{"unit_id":"Mandarin715__dsh-autostart#card-en","repo":"Mandarin715/dsh-autostart","commit":"4c6589403ac82aab405f55184d28353d297a3b30","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-autostart adds Windows boot autostart and restart controls to DSH web settings. The settings card shows service status and the latest access URL, and lets users manage autostart, configure a post-start hook, and restart DSH through a resident supervisor. Requires Windows and Node.js 20+.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:303-324","index.js:648-669","service.js:4-20"]}
