{"unit_id":"Mandarin715__dsh-autostart#feature-1","repo":"Mandarin715/dsh-autostart","commit":"4c6589403ac82aab405f55184d28353d297a3b30","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-autostart 的功能「登录时自启」：在通用设置卡启用或停用 DSH 的 Windows 登录自启动项，并保存 supervisor 启动所需配置。通过设置卡的自启按钮触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:417-491","lib/registry.js:1-40"]}
{"unit_id":"Mandarin715__dsh-autostart#feature-2","repo":"Mandarin715/dsh-autostart","commit":"4c6589403ac82aab405f55184d28353d297a3b30","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-autostart 的功能「服务状态与访问地址」：设置卡读取服务状态、监听端口和启动输出中的最新访问地址，并提供复制操作。打开通用设置卡即可查看。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:282-315","client.js:174-224"]}
